  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/form-elements.html#the-textarea-element:textcontent\r\n\r\n> When the `<textarea>` element's `textContent` IDL attribute changes value,\r\n\r\nI was under the impression that this `COME FROM` style of spec-ese is discouraged.\r\nI would think [`textContent`](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-node-textcontent)'s setter should offer a hook, to which `<textarea>` would then register a \"callback\" for the algorithm in question?",
